        <mxCell id="text_L03_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Crop &amp; Solar Drying Telemetry with Deduplicated Alert Episodes&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A10 (Farm Monitoring §1) | B08, B09, B10]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;2 nodes/farm: crop (6 readings/day), drying (24/day). IoT Core mTLS ingestion, DynamoDB telemetry store, alert episodes (ASM-135) via SMS and mobile push.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
