        <mxCell id="text_L04_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Scale-Measured Harvest Weight &amp; 60 kg Standard Reference&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A16 (Sack &amp; Trip §2)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Scale-measured weight recorded digitally at wet mill registration; 60 kg serves as nominal commercial reference (ASM-150). Cryptographic sack ID code generated.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
