        <mxCell id="text_L05_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Two-Leg Overland Journey Tracking &amp; Custody Handoffs&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A10 / A16 (Sack &amp; Trip §5)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Leg 1 (farm to center) &amp; Leg 2 (center to Buenaventura). GNSS fixes every 5 min (transport_position) and explicit custody handoffs (sack_custody) via transporter outbox.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
