        <mxCell id="text_L06_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Public Sack Lookup Front Door (Restricted Buyer View)&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A09 / A16 (Sack &amp; Trip §7) | B04]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Unauthenticated lookup via CloudFront + AWS WAF + Lambda URL (ASM-058, PD-051). Restricted to buyer view (variety, cup score, certs); farmer cédula and internal trace withheld.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
