        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="text_L08_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Application API Contracts &amp; Backend Integration Surface&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A09 (Automation &amp; Pipelines §2)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Case statement confirms apps are planned but not built in challenge scope. 2026 delivers REST/GraphQL APIs, Cognito User Pools (staff MFA / field passwordless), and ingestion contracts.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="1028" width="1190" height="76" as="geometry" />
