        <mxCell id="reason_L15" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#9b2c2c;&quot;&gt;Reason for Retirement: Hardware Evolution to Functional Device Classes (Connectivity §4.1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Specific 2020 IoT microcontroller models and obsolete sensor hardware dropped. Replaced by standardized functional device classes (field nodes, ground station, mobile outbox) specified by A10 and priced by A23.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;html=1;" vertex="1">
