        <mxCell id="reason_L16" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#9b2c2c;&quot;&gt;Reason for Retirement: Independent Cloud Evaluation &amp; Multi-Cloud Strategy (ADR-001)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;2020 cloud choices retired completely. Modern multi-cloud strategy formulated anew under ADR-001: AWS primary (us-east-1) for production workloads, and Azure prepared as an export target (10.88.0.0/13, undeployed).&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;html=1;" vertex="1">
