        <mxCell id="reason_L17" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#9b2c2c;&quot;&gt;Reason for Retirement: Zero Legacy Replication | Modern Event-Driven Cloud Platform (A19)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Case statement explicitly bans replicating the 2020 monolithic/ad-hoc architecture. 2026 delivers a clean-sheet, event-driven, serverless architecture documented in A19 and the complete architecture diagram.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;html=1;" vertex="1">
